  m_Entries:
  - m_Id: 466677760
    m_Key: Endless Runner
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 529592320
    m_Key: 'Run through five worlds: dodge crates, jump hurdles, slide under barriers and climb ramps onto wagons to grab the coins. Eight campaign levels with three stars each, plus an endless run. Two looks: the classic worlds and the Night Shift.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 533786624
    m_Key: Classic
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 533786625
    m_Key: 'The bright cartoon runner: five sunny, snowy, moonlit and fiery worlds, a kid in a hoodie and gold coins.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 533786626
    m_Key: Night Shift
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 533786627
    m_Key: 'A courier''s run through the night city: wet streets, the subway, the docks, the highway and the rooftops at dawn.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 533786628
    m_Key: Sunny Meadows
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 533786629
    m_Key: Sunset Canyon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 533786630
    m_Key: Frosty Peaks
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 533786631
    m_Key: Moonlit Woods
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 533786632
    m_Key: Lava Land
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 533786633
    m_Key: Downtown
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 533786634
    m_Key: Subway
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 533786635
    m_Key: The Docks
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 533786636
    m_Key: The Highway
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 533786637
    m_Key: The Rooftops
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 533786638
    m_Key: Sunny Start
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 533786639
    m_Key: 'Learn the ropes in the meadows: dodge the crates, hop the hurdles and grab every coin you can.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 533786640
    m_Key: Ramp It Up
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 533786641
    m_Key: Wagons roll through the fields. Run up the ramps to reach the coins stacked on top.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 533786642
    m_Key: Duck and Dash
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 533786643
    m_Key: Sunset in the canyon. Slide under the barriers and let the bounce pads throw you sky-high.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 533786644
    m_Key: Canyon Leap
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 533786645
    m_Key: Rivers cut the road in two. Time your jumps - or find the bridge.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 533786646
    m_Key: Runaway carts are rolling down the mountain. Keep your eyes open!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 533786647
    m_Key: Avalanche Alley
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 533786648
    m_Key: Leap from wagon to wagon high above the snow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 533786649
    m_Key: Moonlight Run
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 533786650
    m_Key: Everything you have learned, under the stars. Follow the glowing road.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 533786651
    m_Key: Lava Rush
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 533786652
    m_Key: The final run across the burning land. Only the bravest make it to the end!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 533786653
    m_Key: Endless Run
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 533786654
    m_Key: No finish line. Run through every world while the speed keeps climbing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 533786655
    m_Key: First Shift
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 533786656
    m_Key: Your first night on the job. Dodge the dumpsters, clear the road blocks and grab every credit chip on the way.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 533786657
    m_Key: Loading Zone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 533786658
    m_Key: Delivery trucks line the street. Run up the loading ramps to reach the chips stacked on their roofs.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 533786659
    m_Key: Under the City
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 533786660
    m_Key: The subway after midnight. Slide under the scaffolds and let the lift pads throw you up to the lights.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 533786661
    m_Key: Mind the Gap
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 533786662
    m_Key: The tracks cut the platform in two. Time your jumps - or find the steel bridge.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 533786663
    m_Key: Night Freight
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 533786664
    m_Key: Mail carts roll loose between the containers. Keep your eyes open in the fog.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 533786665
    m_Key: Container Run
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 533786666
    m_Key: Leap from truck to truck along the harbour.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 533786667
    m_Key: Red Lights
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 533786668
    m_Key: Everything you have learned, on the highway at night. Follow the sodium lights.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 533786669
    m_Key: Last Drop
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 533786670
    m_Key: The final run over the rooftops as the sun comes up. Only the best couriers make the drop.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 533786671
    m_Key: No finish line. Run through the whole city while the pace keeps climbing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
